    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take to the skies over the western front in this fantasy alternate timeline WW1 casual run and gun style sim-shooter. Fly as a heroic pilot of the Allied Empires as you take on nefarious Soviet forces.</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Touch / Mouse / XBOX controller</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly 44 allied missions against the Greater Soviet Union</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack Soviet airships, bombers, ground forces, and aces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate Soviet territory to complete clandestine reconnaissance and attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn endurance missions, medals, and increase your rank as you complete the story missions</p></li></ul>",
